{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":134,"count":21,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L02-1-03\",\"点钟\",\"點鐘\",\"点钟\",\"M\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"現在幾點鐘？","pinyin":"Xiànzài jǐ diǎnzhōng?","english":"What time is it now?","sourceCardId":"B1L02-1-04","sourceFront":"現在","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L06-1-06\",\"足球\",\"足球\",\"足球\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那個孩子很愛踢足球。","pinyin":"Nà ge háizi hěn ài tī zúqiú.","english":"That kid loves to play soccer very much.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-07","sourceFront":"踢","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"足(foot) + 球(ball) → the foot ball: 足球(soccer; football)."},{"key":"[\"B1L09-1-15\",\"作业\",\"作業\",\"作业\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"中文老師每天都給我們作業。","pinyin":"Zhōngwén lǎoshī měi tiān dōu gěi wǒmen zuòyè.","english":"The Chinese teacher gives us homework every day.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-1-15","sourceFront":"作業","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"桌子上放著很多張紙，都是弟弟要寫的書法作業。","pinyin":"Zhuōzi shàng fàngzhe hěn duō zhāng zhǐ, dōu shì dìdi yào xiě de shūfǎ zuòyè.","english":"There are many sheets of paper placed on the table; they are all the calligraphy homework that my younger brother needs to write.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-3-02","sourceFront":"紙","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我得寫完作業，才可以跟你去看電影。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-2-17","sourceFront":"才","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了提高英文程度，我除了認真上課、寫作業，還每天聽收音機的英文廣播。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-40","sourceFront":"提高","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天的作業是寫一篇作文，可是我的腦子空空的，一個字也寫不出來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-12","sourceFront":"空","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的歷史作業寫完了，同時也把明天要報告的古蹟資料準備好了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-03","sourceFront":"同時","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"週六你到我家來寫作業，或者我們一起到圖書館去讀書也行。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-09","sourceFront":"或者","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我明天要把這份作業交給老師，遲了老師就不收了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-02","sourceFront":"遲","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L02-2-01\",\"出门\",\"出門\",\"出门\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我一出門就看見朋友在外面等我。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-2-02","sourceFront":"看見","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"他們特地穿上情侶裝出門，好像要告訴大家他們是幸福的情侶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-22","sourceFront":"情侶裝","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他們特地穿上情侶裝出門，好像要告訴大家他們是幸福的情侶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-23","sourceFront":"情侶","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了避免皮膚受傷，夏天出門時別忘了戴上帽子和太陽眼鏡。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-22","sourceFront":"避免","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"新聞報告說颱風快來了，出門時得注意安全。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-02","sourceFront":"颱風","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"強烈的陽光對我們的眼睛不好，出門活動時最好戴上太陽眼鏡。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-03","sourceFront":"強烈","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"糟了！衣服被咖啡弄髒了，我得換一件才能出門。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-25","sourceFront":"糟","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"從明天起天氣會變冷，溫度會比今天降低五度，出門時最好穿上外套。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-35","sourceFront":"降低","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"秋天的天氣變化很大，早晚都有點涼，出門時最好帶件外套。 這碗魚湯要趁熱喝，涼了就不好喝了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-22","sourceFront":"涼","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"氣象預報說，從明天起一連三天，中部以北地氣溫只有十五度，出門時最好加件外套。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-34","sourceFront":"氣溫","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"林阿姨來我家推銷保險，我不好意思當面拒絕她，只好假裝有急事要出門。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-16","sourceFront":"當面","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"網路商店滿足了人們購物的需求，就是不出門，也可買到各式各樣的生活用品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-08","sourceFront":"可","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"鄰居有急事得出門處理，請我暫時幫他照顧孩子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-21","sourceFront":"暫時","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"最近天氣不太穩定，氣溫的變化很大，出門時最好帶把傘。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-13","sourceFront":"穩定","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"網路是很偉大的發明，就算不出門，也能讓人們得到全球各地的訊息。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-20","sourceFront":"發明","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今明兩天的天氣可能從晴天轉雨天，出門前記得帶傘。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-05","sourceFront":"轉","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"出門上班前，我才發現短裙破了，不得不先補號再去上班，結果就遲到了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-49","sourceFront":"補","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在交通不方便的地區上班，得一大早就出門才行。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-05","sourceFront":"一大早","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:你快點把衣服換好。還不出門，就趕不上飛機嘍？ B:好啦，我知道了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-07","sourceFront":"嘍","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我通常在家吃晚餐，只有好朋友邀請我吃飯，才會出門。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-29","sourceFront":"通常","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他的臉色白不是因為不舒服，是因為他平日很少出門。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-13","sourceFront":"臉色","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"外面風大，最好穿件外套出門，免得感冒了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-51","sourceFront":"免得","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次傳染病的病毒很厲害，出門得戴著口罩，免得被傳染。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-06","sourceFront":"傳染","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L03-1-34\",\"这边\",\"這邊\",\"这边\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"請把洗衣機放在這邊，冰箱放在那邊。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-34","sourceFront":"這邊","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L10-1-26\",\"年紀\",\"年紀\",\"年纪\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我大哥今年三十歲了，我們的年紀差了十歲。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-26","sourceFront":"年紀","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"那個老人年紀太大，沒辦法一個人生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-29","sourceFront":"老人","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"那個小孩年紀太小，不會自己穿衣服、脫褲子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-20","sourceFront":"脫","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"像踢足球那樣的運動，對年紀大的人不太合適。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-04","sourceFront":"合適","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他雖然年紀小，但是對人有禮貌，也很體貼父母，是個乖孩子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-08","sourceFront":"乖","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那位老太太年紀大了，沒辦法照顧他的狗，所以想幫狗找個新主人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-28","sourceFront":"主人","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我爺爺年紀大了，不但體力不好，還有頭痛、肩膀痛的毛病","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-08","sourceFront":"毛病","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小高希望能早日退休，回鄉下照顧年紀大的父母。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-16","sourceFront":"早日","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"弟弟：爺爺怎麼常把我和你的名字搞錯？ 哥哥：爺爺年紀太大了，腦子不清楚，好像不認得我們了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-29","sourceFront":"認得","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:哎，有沒有看見我的錢包？ B:哎，你怎麼又在找東西了呢？ A:哎，年紀大了就是這樣？ B:哎，你還年輕呢！讓我幫你一起找吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-05","sourceFront":"哎","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在公車上，看到年紀大的人應該讓位子請他們坐。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-16","sourceFront":"讓","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L14-2-09\",\"無所謂\",\"無所謂\",\"无所谓\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"吃什麼我無所謂，不要太辣的就沒問題。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-2-09","sourceFront":"無所謂","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這部電影一點兒都不吸引人，就算錯過了也無所謂。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-18","sourceFront":"錯過","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"對我來說，食物營養不營養無所謂，只要好吃就行了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-15","sourceFront":"營養","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L15-2-03\",\"教師\",\"教師\",\"教师\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"「教師節」這個節日是為了紀念偉大的孔子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-05","sourceFront":"節日","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"大寶明年有去英國留學的打算，所以找了家庭教師幫他補習， 希望提高英文程度。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-07","sourceFront":"補習班","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"孔子不僅是中國偉大教師的代表，他的教育和哲學思想，對華人的影響也很大。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-03","sourceFront":"代表","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果想當語言教師，得先考取教師證書，將來找工作較順利。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-11","sourceFront":"考取","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L03-1-38\",\"货比三家不吃亏\",\"貨比三家不吃虧\",\"货比三家不吃亏\",\"Ph\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你先別急著買，貨比三家不吃虧，多看幾家再決定吧！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-38","sourceFront":"貨比三家不吃虧","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L07-1-28\",\"缩短\",\"縮短\",\"缩短\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"便利的交通，不僅縮短了南北城市的距離，也節省了人們寶貴的時間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-28","sourceFront":"縮短","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"自從有了高速鐵路，不僅縮短了交通時間，人與人之間的距離也變近了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-22","sourceFront":"高速","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L08-2-15\",\"冷靜\",\"冷靜\",\"冷静\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那棟大樓發生火災時，還好安全人員很冷靜，才能帶著大家安全地離開。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-15","sourceFront":"冷靜","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"開車時萬一發生車禍，千萬要冷靜，以免情況更嚴重。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-60","sourceFront":"千萬","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 冷(cold) and 靜(still): 冷靜 means calm down."},{"key":"[\"B3L16-2-23\",\"发达\",\"發達\",\"发达\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"在雲端科技發達的時代裡，人人都能夠透過網路交友、學習。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-23","sourceFront":"發達","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"現代社會資訊很發達，一發生重要事情，立刻就上電視、上報了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-01","sourceFront":"資訊","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"由於網路發達，現代人大都習慣上網購物。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-14","sourceFront":"大都","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L05-2-22\",\"原子筆\",\"原子筆\",\"原子笔\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他很喜歡買文具，尤其是筆，各國進口的原子筆他都有。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-22","sourceFront":"原子筆","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"傲\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A 亻(person) stands tall like a 士(scholar) with a 方(direction) to point, then a 攵(rap) on the back makes him too 傲(proud)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"吃虧\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"To 吃(eat) a 虧(loss): 吃虧 means suffer losses, to be taken advantage of."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"家人\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Home (家) + person (人) → the people of your home: family members."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"新年\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"新(new) + 年(year) → the new year: 新年(New Year)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"網\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 糹(silk) thread traps a 罔(to deceive) fish → 網(net)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"課\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 言(speech) plants a 果(fruit) in a garden → that is one 課(subject)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"農\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A 曲(crooked) furrow is plowed at 辰(early morning) to grow crops → 農(agriculture)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"道德\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 道(method) and 德(ethics): 道德 means morals, ethics."}]}
